    "Reads HRV, resting heart rate, respiratory rate and last night's sleep from Apple Health with your permission. Your data stays on device and is never uploaded." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reads HRV, resting heart rate, respiratory rate and last night's sleep from Apple Health with your permission. Your data stays on device and is never uploaded."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "あなたの許可のもと、Apple Health から HRV、安静時心数、呼吸数、昨夜の睡眠を読み取ります。データは端末内にのみ保存され、アップロードされることはありません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "귀하의 허락을 받아 Apple 건강에서 HRV, 안정 심박수, 호흡수, 어젯밤 수면을 읽어옵니다. 데이터는 기기에만 저장되며 절대 업로드되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "经你授权后从 Apple 健康读取 HRV、静息心率、呼吸频率和昨晚的睡眠。数据仅保存在本机，永远不会上传。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "經你授權後從 Apple 健康讀取 HRV、靜息心率、呼吸頻率和昨晚的睡眠。資料僅保存在本機，永遠不會上傳。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
