    "StudyPulse also reads your heart rate, breathing rate, and last night's sleep to recommend the right kind of study session for your body." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "StudyPulse also reads your heart rate, breathing rate, and last night's sleep to recommend the right kind of study session for your body."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "StudyPulse は心拍数、呼吸数、昨夜の睡眠も読み取り、その時の体の状態に合った学習方法を提案します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "StudyPulse는 심박수, 호흡수, 어젯밤 수면도 읽어 현재 몸 상태에 맞는 공부 방식을 추천합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "StudyPulse 还会读取你的心率、呼吸频率和昨晚的睡眠，为你推荐适合当前身体状态的学习方式。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "StudyPulse 還會讀取你的心率、呼吸頻率和昨晚的睡眠，為你推薦適合當下身體狀態的學習方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
