    },
    "StudyPulse helps students track performance and manage study materials.\nStudyPulse 成绩追踪与学习资料管理应用" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "StudyPulse helps students track performance and manage study materials.\nStudyPulse 成绩追踪与学习资料管理应用"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "StudyPulse は学生が学業の進捗を追跡し、学習資料を管理するのを支援します。\nStudyPulse 成績追跡と学習資料管理アプリ"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "StudyPulse는 학생이 학습 진행 상황을 추적하고 학습 자료를 관리하도록 도와줍니다.\nStudyPulse 성적 추적 및 학습 자료 관리 앱"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "StudyPulse helps students track performance and manage study materials.\nStudyPulse 成绩追踪与学习资料管理应用"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "StudyPulse 幫助學生追蹤學習表現並管理學習資料。\nStudyPulse 成績追蹤與學習資料管理應用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StudyPulse is a comprehensive learning management application designed to help students track their academic performance, analyze trends, and manage their study materials effectively." : {
      "comment" : "About App Description",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "StudyPulse is a comprehensive learning management application designed to help students track their academic performance, analyze trends, and manage their study materials effectively."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "StudyPulseは、学生が学業の進捗を追跡し、傾向を分析し、学習教材を効果的に管理できるように設計された総合的な学習管理アプリケーションです。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "StudyPulse는 학생들이 학업 성과를 추적하고 추세를 분석하며 학습 자료를 효과적으로 관리할 수 있도록 설계된 종합 학습 관리 애플리케이션입니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "StudyPulse 是一款综合性学习管理应用，旨在帮助学生追踪学业表现、分析学习趋势，并高效管理学习资料。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "StudyPulse 是一款綜合性學習管理應用程式，旨在幫助學生追蹤學業表現、分析學習趨勢，並高效管理學習資料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StudyPulse Learning Report" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "StudyPulse Learning Report"
