    "When enabled, weekly and monthly reports include a 4th \"Metacognition Reflection\" section that connects your mood / energy with study performance to guide self-awareness. Requires LLM to be configured." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When enabled, weekly and monthly reports include a 4th \"Metacognition Reflection\" section that connects your mood / energy with study performance to guide self-awareness. Requires LLM to be configured."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有効にすると、週次・月次レポートに第4の「メタ認知振り返り」セクションが追加され、気分・エネルギーと学習成果を結びつけて自己認識を深めます。LLMの設定が必要です。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "활성화하면 주간・월간 보고서에 제4의 \"메타인지 회고\" 섹션이 추가되어 기분・에너지와 학습 성과를 연결해 자기 인식을 돕습니다. LLM 설정이 필요합니다."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "启用后,周报和月报将包含第 4 段\"元认知反思\",将心情/精力与学习表现关联,引导自我觉察。需配置 LLM。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "啟用後,週報和月報將包含第 4 段「後設認知反思」,將心情/精力與學習表現關聯,引導自我覺察。需配置 LLM。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
